<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Materia Alba, Dental Plaque, Calculus Comparison</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js">
</script>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a4a4a 0%, #6b6b6b 30%, #9a9a9a 50%, #5a5a5a 70%, #3a3a3a 100%);
    min-height: 768px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .content-box {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 14px solid #000000;
    margin: 100px 15px 0 15px;
    padding: 20px 30px 30px 30px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }

  .columns {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .column {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 0 15px;
  }

  .column:first-child {
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .col-header {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: #333333;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .column ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .column ul li {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 15px;
    left: 15px;
    right: 15px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
  }

  .footer-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .title-text {
    color: #ffff33;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .date-text {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .center-text {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 14px;
    align-self: flex-end;
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .page-num {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="content-box">
    <div class="columns">
      <div class="column">
        <p class="col-header">Materia Alba</p>
        <ul>
          <li>White cheeselike accumulation</li>
          <li>A soft accumulation of salivary proteins, some bacteria, many desquamated epithelial cells, and occasional disintegrating food debris</li>
          <li>Lacks an organized structure and is therefore not as complex as dental plaque</li>
          <li>Easily displaced with a water spray</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="column">
        <p class="col-header">Dental Plaque</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Resilient clear to yellow-grayish substance</li>
          <li>Primarily composed of bacteria in a matrix of salivary glycoproteins and extracellular polysaccharides</li>
          <li>Considered to be a biofilm</li>
          <li>Impossible to remove by rinsing or the use of sprays</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="column">
        <p class="col-header">Calculus</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Hard deposit that forms by mineralization of dental plaque</li>
          <li>Generally covered by a layer of unmineralized dental plaque</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div class="footer-left">
      <span class="title-text">Carranza 11<sup>th</sup> edition</span>
      <span class="date-text">12/27/2011</span>
    </div>
    <span class="center-text">DENTAL PAQUE</span>
    <span class="page-num">17</span>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
